# BALLAST — Discover, Create, and project links

Read `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/BALLAST-build-spec.md`, `docs/BALLAST-visual-upgrade.md`
and `docs/BALLAST-ui-density.md` first. Palette, typography, motion and copy
rules all still apply.

Two references, used differently:

- **Uniswap's launchpad** — the information architecture. Stats row, featured
  strip, sort rail. Take the structure.
- **Pons' create form** — the upload interaction. Take the behaviour.

Neither is a visual reference. Our palette, serif headings and meander stay.

Run every phase in order. Commit after each. Push to main at the end.

