## PHASE 4 — Featured strip

Beneath the stats, above the tabs: up to four project cards, larger than the
list cards below.

Each shows logo, name, ticker, market cap, and — where Uniswap shows a
bonding-curve progress bar — **the backing bar**.

That substitution is the point. We have no bonding curve and no graduation
event, so a progress bar would be meaningless. Show the locked versus
creator-withdrawable split as a two-segment bar with the backing ratio beside
it. Unbacked tokens show no bar and read `Not ballasted`.

Selection rule, stated on the strip: ranked by locked backing, descending. If
fewer than four qualify, show fewer rather than padding with unbacked ones.

The protocol token stays pinned above this strip, labelled as pinned. It must
never appear inside the ranked strip.

