## PHASE 6 — Polish

- Constrain to the 1200px container from the density spec.
- One card treatment throughout: `#181F1B` surface, 1px `#232B25` border, no
  shadow. Cards carrying backing data get the `#1B3A20` accent border.
- Hover lifts the surface and brightens the border. No transform scale.
- Featured cards stagger in ~40ms apart as data resolves, capped.
- Backing bars animate width from 0 on first paint only.
- Mobile: stats row becomes 2×2; featured strip scrolls horizontally with snap
  points; sort rail scrolls horizontally.
- Visible focus ring on every interactive element.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables all of it. Verify in a browser.

