## What not to do

- No progress bars implying a graduation that doesn't exist.
- No "verified" label on self-declared links.
- No flame or rocket icons, no gradient buttons.
- No hiding a figure because it is small.
- No sort that can't be computed from a real source.
- No new dependency for icons or charts. Inline SVG.

Marketing must stay free of the web3 bundle.

